    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d74-a5">

                <pb facs="0214" n="118" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg118"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure E.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Saturday</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-07-20"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 20,
                        1872</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Hon. J. P. Root, though scarcely convalescent from his recent attack of
                    smallpox, has again taken his seat at the board, and a few days ago he visited
                    all the hospitals in company with Dr. Aguirre, and we are happy to say that his
                    inspection has been the means of introducing many beneficial reforms in the
                    lazarettes.</p>
            </div>
